    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember smacking the TV to fix it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if that actually changed what was ON the TV?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic comedy adventure, your old TV isn\u2019t just for watching\u2014it\u2019s how you control the game. Smack it from all sides to shake up the broadcast.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each channel is a surprise: beat mini-games,  solve surreal puzzles and watch how your actions twist the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/0901926aebbad67b3196c04d1c0caa76.poster.avif?t=1749924566\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/0901926aebbad67b3196c04d1c0caa76.webm?t=1749924566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/0901926aebbad67b3196c04d1c0caa76.mp4?t=1749924566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Just a few totally normal scenarios you might find yourself in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance the Leaning Tower of Pisa!</strong> Why use engineering skills when you can use force?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate the weather: </strong>Summer in January? Why not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch (or sabotage!) a NASA shuttle!</strong> Oops,<strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">maybe blame it on the communists?</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/6c4e881e77770592a7541b6b50be0acf.poster.avif?t=1749924566\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/6c4e881e77770592a7541b6b50be0acf.webm?t=1749924566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/6c4e881e77770592a7541b6b50be0acf.mp4?t=1749924566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Packed with minigames and puzzles: </strong>expect bizarre WarioWare-style challenges and surreal puzzles inspired by 90s TV channels. No two are the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter: </strong>Your hits - erm, decisions - shape how each absurd scenario plays out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable: </strong>Challenge yourself to find every gag, conspiracy and ending</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funnier than binging 90s sitcoms again.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/800acf001e9009760de89b235adefc81.poster.avif?t=1749924566\" width=506 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/800acf001e9009760de89b235adefc81.webm?t=1749924566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/800acf001e9009760de89b235adefc81.mp4?t=1749924566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> DISCLAIMER:\u00a0</strong><i>NO TVs WERE HARMED IN THE MAKING OF THIS GAME.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Okay\u2014maybe just one. We made an alternative-controller version of the game using an actual CRT TV. Sorry, TV.)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just sit there staring at the static \u2014<strong>\u00a0wishlist &quot;Breaking News&quot; now!</strong> \ud83d\udcfa</p>",
